# /emori/speech/say. Speaks a sentence of at most 200 characters on the robot's own speaker.
# Refused while a live session or an add-on mode owns the speaker, or the kiosk is anywhere but
# an idle landing page, and cut short if one of those starts while it plays.
string text
string lang
---
bool played
string error_code           # session_active|addon_busy|kiosk_busy|speaker_busy|no_voice|too_long|play_failed
---
string stage                # synth|play
